/30501 ) \n Document that ggml_gated_delta_net only guarantees the latest state slot when n_tokens > K ( llama/29353 ) \n Default symbol visibility is now hidden, removing internal symbols accidentally exported through GGML_API ( llama/30014 ) \n \n Core changes \n \n Fix out-of-bounds write in ggml_acc / ggml_set when a negative offset sign-extends past the bounds check ( llama/30135 ) \n Fix ggml_conv_1d result layout for batched input so the output is [N, OC, OL] ( llama/28738 ) \n Make CLAMP correct on non-contiguous views in the CPU and CUDA backends ( llama/29517 ) \n Meta backend: treat views of host-buffer tensors as unsplit and skip them in subgraph mapping ( llama/30217 ) \n Meta backend: recreate all subgraphs when the compute arena is reallocated ( llama/30453 ) \n RPC: make GGML_RPC_DEBUG a verbosity level, add transport logs and clearer tensor transfer logs ( llama/29544 , llama/30481 ) \n \n Backend changes \n CPU \n \n Add AVX2 dot product kernel for Q2_0 ( llama/30447 ) \n KleidiAI: add SME2 matmul for Q4_K and route Q6_K to the Q8_0 path ( llama/29219 ) \n Restore the FP16->FP32 lookup table when F16C is available, and fix AVX2 builds not using F16C ( llama/30342 , llama/30343 , llama/30270 ) \n Vectorize the fp32->fp16 conversion and optimize pad_f32 ( llama/30157 , llama/30526 ) \n Add F16 reference implementation and validation for SWIGLU_OAI ( llama/29200 ) \n Size the set_rows conversion buffer for all threads ( llama/30454 ) \n \n CUDA / HIP \n \n Add chunked gated-delta-net kernels, plus more GDN state columns per warp ( llama/29353 , llama/30087 ) \n Support arbitrary striding in unary ops on f16/f32/bf16 and byte-strided ROLL on non-contiguous inputs ( llama/29781 , llama/29547 ) \n Improve top-k algorithm selection ( llama/28713 ) \n Add BF16 support for XIELU and chunk BF16/FP16->FP32 conversions ( llama/29955 , llama/29442 ) \n FWHT for block widths above 512, SIMT implicit GEMM conv2d without WMMA, better pool2d coalescing ( llama/29100 , llama/30325 , llama/29425 ) \n Prefer MMVQ for MUL_MAT_ID on sm_60 and pass src1 precision to host MMQ config helpers ( llama/27828 , llama/30168 ) \n Fix MMQ out-of-bounds reads and alignment assumptions when bias-add is fused ( llama/29953 , llama/30133 ) \n Handle tensors beyond grid dimension limits in the PAD and norm family kernels ( llama/30147 , llama/28175 ) \n Fix flash attention race when combining partial results and drop redundant copies after SSM_SCAN ( llama/30103 , llama/29807 ) \n Fix the CCCL version guard on major version rollover and CPU/GPU rounding agreement under MSVC ( llama/29453 , llama/30229 ) \n Add GGML_CUDA_GRAPH_DEBUG , read backend env vars once, and use per-thread streams for buffer-init memset ( llama/30327 , llama/28782 ) \n HIP: 64-row MMQ tiles for selected quant types on RDNA3.5 ( llama/28195 ) \n MUSA: use the tile lightning indexer kernel, fix FWHT, drop an obsolete default architecture ( llama/30080 , llama/30167 , llama/30203 ) \n \n Metal \n \n Add a BF16 tensor-API flash attention kernel and new 128/96 head-dim FA kernels combinable across dtypes ( llama/30491 , llama/30209 ) \n Extend the few-row MMA mat-mul to the remaining src0 types and fix tensor-API mul_mm on large tensors ( llama/30065 , llama/28748 ) \n Fix MUL_MAT+ADD fusion when the residual is itself a MUL_MAT, and excess threadgroup memory in quantized FA ( llama/30100 , llama/29340 ) \n Fix mul_mat_id with duplicate expert ids ( llama/30373 ) \n \n Vulkan \n \n L2-friendly workgroup scheduling for coopmat2 matmuls, and dispatch splitting beyond workgroup count limits ( llama/30215 , llama/29533 ) \n Support bf16 activations in mul_mat and extend sparse flash attention to coopmat2 ( llama/29069 , llama/30003 ) \n Handle duplicate mul_mat_id ids in the prepass instead of looping, and use 4 rows for NVIDIA MUL_MAT_ID MMVQ ( llama/29998 , llama/29274 ) \n Overhaul host-visible memory so several devices can share it, and fix concurrent first-device initialization ( llama/29741 , llama/29766 ) \n Copy strided f16 KV once on AMD so reads spread across memory channels ( llama/27703 ) \n Pack FMAs for f16 accumulation without the dot product op, and speed up large-window pool_2d ( llama/29877 , llama/30119 ) \n Fixes: TOP_K with +inf/NaN and k = 1 on negatives, rms_norm workgroup overflow, slow AMD iGPU reads ( llama/30107 , llama/30145 , llama/30049 ) \n Intel GPU workarounds: handle free memory reporting above total memory, set shader counts for Arc Pro B65/B70 ( llama/29835 , llama/30431 ) \n \n SYCL \n \n Accelerate MoE with arithmetic decoding and weight reordering for MXFP4, IQ3 and Q5_K reorder layouts ( llama/29809 , llama/29107 , llama/29500 , llama/29375 ) \n Add grouped MoE XMX GEMM and fuse the delta-net alpha gate (add + unary + mul) ([llama/29245]( ggml-org/llama.cpp#2 ... \n \n Read more \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Assets \n 2 \n \n \n \n \n \n Loading \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n Uh oh!\n \n There was an error while loading. Please reload this page . \n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n \n --> \n \n \n \n \n \n All reactions \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n v0.26.0 \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n v0.26.0 \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n Compare \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n Choose a tag to compare\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Sorry, something went wrong. \n \n \n \n \n \n Filter\n \n \n \n \n \n Loading \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Sorry, something went wrong. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n Uh oh!\n \n There was an error while loading. Please reload this page . \n \n\n \n \n \n \n No results found \n \n \n \n View all tags \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n github-actions \n\n released this\n\n \n 05 Oct 14:36\n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n \n \n \n v0.26.0\n \n \n \n \n \n d7cb574 \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n This commit was created on GitHub.com and signed with GitHub’s verified signature .\n \n \n\n\n \n GPG key ID: B5690EEEBB952194 \n \n \n Verified\n \n \n Learn about vigilant mode .\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n Overview \n ggml v0.26.0 brings a new alloc_buffer_n / get_alloc_size_n buffer allocation API, sparse flash attention kernels on SYCL, Vulkan and Metal, and major lightning indexer improvements (halved score memory, tiling, MUSA support). The CPU backend gains BF16 ops and a tiled k-quant mul_mat, CUDA gains a model-driven W4A4 (NVFP4/MXFP4) mul_mat path plus MMVQ shared-expert fusion, and the Hexagon backend adds a sampler and more quant types. Model loading is faster with stricter GGUF size validation, Windows ARM64 MSVC builds are enabled, and WebGPU/OpenVINO/OpenCL/SYCL pick up numerous new kernels, ops and fixes. \n API changes \n \n Add alloc_buffer_n and get_alloc_size_n to the buffer type interface with public APIs ggml_backend_buft_alloc_buffer_n / ggml_backend_buft_get_alloc_size_n for multi-buffer allocation and size planning ( llama/23671 ) \n Add new public header include/ggml-zdnn.h for the zDNN backend ( llama/29541 ) \n \n Core changes \n \n Speed up model loading and fix a hang on crafted GGUFs with very large KV dimensions ( llama/29598 ) \n Harden tensor/GGUF size validation: fix integer overflows and reject tensor sizes that wrap after padding ( llama/29384 , llama/26979 ) \n Collect all input tensors into graph_inputs up front and require them to be GGML_OP_NONE , fixing spurious graph re-reserves with pipeline parallelism ( llama/29634 , llama/29647 ) \n Meta backend: clear inactive AllReduce shards with FILL instead of SCALE ( llama/29793 ) \n ggml-quants: avoid invalid rounding in the qkx3 scale search ( llama/29817 ) \n Enable Windows ARM64 builds with MSVC cl.exe ( llama/28362 ) \n \n Backend changes \n CPU \n \n Support BF16/FP16/FP32 K tails in tinyBLAS on x86 ( llama/29806 ) \n BF16 op support: add unary, GLU, binary and scale ops (with CUDA) and accept BF16 in src1 of mul_mat ( llama/29675 , llama/28937 ) \n Tiled mul_mat for k-quants via int8 unpack tiles and 16x16 microkernels ( llama/27851 ) \n Enable tiled flash attention for non-vector-multiple head dims on x86 ( llama/29423 ) \n Accumulate f16 dot products in f32 on AVX512-FP16 ( llama/29545 ) \n Add Q8_0 IME1 matrix kernel for SpacemiT X60 ( llama/28479 ) \n Fix soft_max_back wrong output when dst aliases src1 ( llama/27096 ) \n \n CUDA / HIP \n \n Add model-driven W4A4 (NVFP4/MXFP4) mul_mat path with llama_prec_policy ( llama/24364 ) \n NVFP4: optimize MMQ accumulation and handle the compute type on the cuBLAS path ( llama/29857 , llama/29173 ) \n Fuse shared experts into MMVQ ( llama/29184 ) \n Use MMVF for thin f16/bf16 mul_mat at small batch size ( llama/29633 ) \n FlashAttention: prefer whole-tile scheduling for two-stage kernels, tune fp16 tile configs for head sizes 40-112, fix 2 broken Volta cases ( llama/29435 , llama/26289 , llama/29803 ) \n Lightning indexer: halve the score memory (CUDA/Metal/Vulkan) and tile over keys and tokens for 4 heads ( llama/29825 , llama/29901 ) \n Fuse RMS_NORM + SCALE into one kernel ( llama/29393 ) \n Bitonic argsort handles rows wider than one block ( llama/28957 ) \n Add F16 support to FWHT and a F16 kernel for CONV_2D_DW ( llama/29096 , llama/29064 ) \n SSM_SCAN: support state size 96 ( llama/28717 ) \n Fixes: batch-independent alloc_deps check, unexpected graph reallocation in k-pool models, MMQ memory fault when n_expert >> n_ubatch, cpy transposed path corrupting non-contiguous dst ( llama/29986 , llama/29958 , llama/29941 , llama/27663 ) \n Make the CCCL version configurable and pin it for CI ( llama/29792 ) \n HIP: enable the fattn-mma kernel on CDNA for dkq > 256 at large batch sizes, fixing template skip and DGX Spark misdetection ( llama/28907 , llama/29559 , llama/29572 ) \n HIP: optimize packed byte subtraction ( llama/29478 ) \n MUSA: fix PH1 (MTT S5000) operator and build issues, use the vector lightning indexer kernel ( llama/29193 , llama/29990 ) \n \n Metal \n \n Flash attention: add tensor API kernel for F16 KV, split FA kernels into per-dtype libraries, optimize sparse FA ( llama/29570 , llama/29329 , llama/29377 ) \n FWHT: support block widths above 512 with perf optimizations ( llama/29095 , llama/29602 ) \n mul_mat: use bf16 math for mxfp4, add few-row MMA mat-mul ( llama/29770 , llama/29869 ) \n Support left and circular padding in GGML_OP_PAD ( llama/29561 ) \n Fix graph capture and handle empty graphs, release temporary private transfer buffers ( llama/29390 , llama/29777 ) \n \n Vulkan \n \n int8 coopmat1 matmul implementation for AMD RDNA3 and RDNA4 ( llama/27952 ) \n Sparse flash attention for quantized K/V ( llama/29639 ) \n Perf: reuse descriptor sets when bindings are constant, fuse the SCALE→SIGMOID→SCALE→HC_POST chain ( llama/29280 , llama/29520 ) \n Flash attention: fix shmem write out of bounds and stale prealloc_y reuse across FA and soft_max ( llama/29988 , llama/29591 ) \n Fix wrong results when a mul_mat reads a slice of a larger cache ( llama/28956 ) \n Tuning: GDN kernel on Intel, RDNA4 mat_vec, disable large matmul tile on Samsung GPUs with 32KB shared memory, argsort kernel selection on Adreno ( llama/29476 , llama/29934 , llama/28531 , llama/29469 ) \n Fix build with legacy GLSLC without cooperativeMatrix API ( llama/29409 ) \n \n WebGPU \n \n Add MMVQ support for Q1_0/Q5_0/Q5_1/Q3_K/Q5_K/Q6_K/MXFP4 ( llama/29483 ) \n Add bfloat16 support for MUL_MAT/MUL_MAT_ID/GET_ROWS and f16 support for fill/set_rows ( llama/29358 , llama/29897 ) \n Fix SSM_SCAN binding aliasing and unaligned writes in buffer_set_tensor ( llama/29750 , llama/29471 ) \n \n SYCL \n \n Add sparse flash attention ( llama/28796 ) \n Q8_0 DMMV ESIMD and MMVQ wide load ( llama/29186 ) \n FWHT kernels for block widths above 512, large register file for D=512 FA vec kernels ( llama/29243 , llama/29062 ) \n Avoid the slow oneDNN reference matmul and fattn ( llama/28985 ) \n Reduce tensor allreduce sync with pinned host buffers ( llama/29604 ) \n \n O