as created on GitHub.com and signed with GitHub’s verified signature .\n \n \n\n\n \n GPG key ID: B5690EEEBB952194 \n \n \n Verified\n \n \n Learn about vigilant mode .\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n ⚠️ Upgrade notes \n \n GitHub polling needs an allowlist. New host-only github.polling_repositories = [\"owner/repo\", ...] ; empty (the default) ignores every notification, so polling deployments must set it ( #4294 ). \n Jira project_keys = [] now disables lookups. The default is now [\"*\"] . If you set [] to mean \"all projects\", change it to [\"*\"] or remove it ( #4049 ). \n litellm.extra_headers is host-only. Repository .pr_agent.toml and comment arguments can no longer set it ( #4287 ). \n Default model is now gpt-6.1-sol with gpt-6-luna as fallback (was gpt-5.6 / gpt-5.6-terra ). Pin config.model to keep the old one ( #4088 ). \n Langfuse SDK 4.18.0 needs self-hosted Langfuse 3.63.0+; use the langfuse_otel callback ( #4343 ). \n GitHub App token in Actions: set github.agent_login to <app-slug>[bot] so PR-Agent recognises its own comments ( #4329 ). \n \n ✨ Highlights \n \n pr-agent doctor preflights a deployment ( #4321 ). \n --json-output for /describe , /improve and /review ( #4265 , #4227 , #4226 ). \n Jira scoped API tokens ( #4250 ), /ask with the CI artifact as context ( #4176 ), globs in repo_context_files ( #4220 ), opt-in GitLab subgroup settings inheritance ( #4059 ). \n Security hardening: DNS rebinding block, repo-context path escapes, host-only config output, loguru diagnose off, more credential redaction ( #4252 , #4279 , #4293 , #4280 , #4328 ). \n \n What's Changed \n \n Redact Stripe, Twilio and SendGrid credentials by @IlyaKhalafi in #4328 \n ci(review): make self-hosted /improve post suggestions again by @Yoel-qin in #4174 \n Enable automatic /review on new PRs (fixes #4162 ) by @kiranmutyala18 in #4170 \n \n 🚀 Features \n \n feat(artifacts): support multiple artifact files by @utsab345 in #4338 \n feat(cli): add a doctor command to preflight the deployment by @Yoel-qin in #4321 \n feat(describe): write the description to --json-output by @Yoel-qin in #4265 \n feat(jira): support scoped API tokens by @utsab345 in #4250 \n feat(repo-context): glob entries and fallback alternatives in repo_context_files by @ira-at-work in #4220 \n feat(ask): include organizational skills in line-level answers by @Yoel-qin in #4225 \n feat(review): list the files left out in the JSON output by @Sajinthan in #4226 \n feat(improve): write suggestions to --json-output by @Sajinthan in #4227 \n feat(ask): answer questions with the CI artifact as context by @Yoel-qin in #4176 \n feat(help): prioritize a matching document in constrained prompts by @oleksii-tumanov in #4101 \n feat(gitlab): add opt-in closest-subgroup settings inheritance by @ashearin in #4059 \n feat(improve): retain equal summaries across files by @oleksii-tumanov in #4128 \n \n 🐛 Bug Fixes \n \n fix(ask_line): defer handler setup until a diff hunk matches by @oleksii-tumanov in #4354 \n fix(mosaico): retain tasks with bounded owner history by @utsab345 in #4337 \n fix(add-docs): retry malformed model responses with fallback models by @PeterDaveHello in #4346 \n fix(routing): count diff hunks without splitting patch lines by @PeterDaveHello in #4344 \n fix: retry whitespace-only model completions by @PeterDaveHello in #4348 \n fix(azure): reject incomplete linked work item responses by @oleksii-tumanov in #4173 \n fix(algo): prefer exact source lines before fuzzy matching by @PeterDaveHello in #4340 \n fix(similar_issue): use the supported Qdrant query API by @PeterDaveHello in #4341 \n fix(azure): handle created events without a web link by @oleksii-tumanov in #4171 \n fix(ask): answer with a note when every changed file is filtered out by @sarankumar1325 in #4336 \n fix(gitlab): paginate repository directory listings by @utsab345 in #4332 \n fix(github): let the operator name the agent login an app token posts as by @sarankumar1325 in #4329 \n fix: reject boolean routing limits by @utsab345 in #4302 \n fix: parse GitLab boolean settings by @utsab345 in #4303 \n fix: stop Gitea changed-files pagination at the advertised total by @fixfon in #4306 \n fix(describe): retain valid YAML file-description chunks by @PeterDaveHello in #4315 \n fix(gitlab): preserve Git line boundaries when resolving fixed threads by @PeterDaveHello in #4313 \n fix(improve): keep embedded fences inside summary diffs by @PeterDaveHello in #4312 \n fix: skip generate_labels, add_docs and update_changelog when all files are filtered by @swayamg20 in #4307 \n fix(help_docs): preserve fenced examples during cleanup by @PeterDaveHello in #4319 \n fix: reject boolean body size limits by @utsab345 in #4301 \n fix: normalize list settings consistently by @utsab345 in #4300 \n fix: restrict polling to allowlisted repositories by @utsab345 in #4294 \n fix: hide host-only configuration output by @utsab345 in #4293 \n fix: anchor incremental reviews to agent comments by @utsab345 in #4292 \n fix: require bot authorship for describe persistent comments by @utsab345 in #4291 \n fix: authorize cross-project GitLab tickets by @utsab345 in #4290 \n fix(config): keep litellm.extra_headers host-only by @fixfon in #4287 \n fix: disable loguru diagnose and backtrace by @utsab345 in #4280 \n fix: reject escaping repo context paths by @utsab345 in #4279 \n fix(github): use the GraphQL endpoint on GitHub Enterprise Server by @MaxFreedomPollard in #4272 \n fix(help_docs): preserve ranked documents that already fit by @PeterDaveHello in #4267 \n fix(review): preserve source characters in patch-based snippets by @PeterDaveHello in #4268 \n fix(review): resolve findings in a chunked review when none were cut by @jadhavgaurav in #4222 \n fix(config): honor settings context selection by @utsab345 in #4251 \n fix(ci): update uv security pin by @utsab345 in #4263 \n fix(ignore): keep bracket expressions in string glob patterns by @utsab345 in #4245 \n fix(skills): treat a string paths value as one path by @utsab345 in #4244 \n fix: parse CRLF plain diffs correctly by @strawberry-little-bear in #4231 \n fix(ignore): cap glob length by @utsab345 in #4259 \n fix: treat scalar PR ignore settings as single values by @kocaemre in #4257 \n fix(security): block DNS rebinding by @utsab345 in #4252 \n fix: normalize scalar PR commands by @utsab345 in #4253 \n fix(bitbucket): read ambiguous diff headers from patch metadata by @utsab345 in #4248 \n fix(outputs): deliver the sinks off the event loop by @utsab345 in #4247 \n fix(polling): avoid rerunning commands found in comment history by @PeterDaveHello in #4239 \n fix(gitlab): publish notice for incomplete merge request diffs by @Evhye38496 in #4234 \n fix(help): render static help without initializing an AI handler by @PeterDaveHello in #4241 \n fix(labels): preserve label changes made during model calls by @PeterDaveHello in #4237 \n fix(bedrock): stop sending temperature to GLM-5 by default by @ira-at-work in #4219 \n fix(repo-context): survive a failed revision lookup by @utsab345 in #4246 \n fix(algo): keep yaml fence stripping linear by @utsab345 in #4232 \n fix: stop bare #N in comments, link text, colours and words becoming tickets by @jay23606 in #4198 \n fix: prevent local config contents in log artifact while preserving PR comment by @wjc2821296948 in #4197 \n fix(describe): fall back on unusable model responses by @PeterDaveHello in #4186 \n fix(gitlab): avoid double-encoding submodule project paths by @PeterDaveHello in #4214 \n fix(changelog): retry empty model responses before publishing by @PeterDaveHello in #4209 \n fix(help_docs): recognize Unicode letters in documentation by @PeterDaveHello in #4206 \n fix: skip review and describe when all files are filtered by @utsab345 in #4204 \n fix(help_docs): recount tokens after cleaning documentation by @PeterDaveHello in #4188 \n fix(review): preserve case-sensitive paths when merging chunks by @PeterDaveHello in #4182 \n fix(gerrit): bound direct git and SSH commands by @oleksii-tumanov in #4177 \n fix(plain-diff): decode Git-quoted file paths by @Aling33 in #4152 \n fix(add_docs): preserve literal indentation in suggestions by @oleksii-tumanov in #4172 \n fix(review): preserve corrected answers for the latest question by @PeterDaveHello in #4166 \n fix(models): avoid same-model retries for authentication failures by @PeterDaveHello in #4167 \n fix(diff): preserve non-LF characters when rebuilding patches by @PeterDaveHello in #4168 \n fix(gitlab): pin repository settings to one revision by @oleksii-tumanov in #4093 \n fix: require Bitbucket Server diff content by @utsab345 in #4111 \n fix(github): read repository settings from one revision by @oleksii-tumanov in #4094 \n fix(gitlab): retry not-ready merge request diffs with bounded backoff by @Yoel-qin in #4150 \n fix: align Bitbucket patches by file path by @utsab345 in #4102 \n fix(diff): split patches on newlines only so line numbers match git by @porkedchop in #4080 \n fix(ask): parse markdown image URLs precisely by @utsab345 in #4087 \n fix(review): merge chunked ticket entries by the real ticket by @utsab345 in #4139 \n fix(jira): default project_keys to wildcard and empty list to disable lookups ( #3887 ) by @itsvrushabh in #4049 \n fix(routing): retain displaced primary in colliding fallback chains by @PeterDaveHello in #4064 \n fix(bitbucket): encode file paths in content reads by @utsab345 in #4095 \n fix: preserve repeated override quote types by @utsab345 in #4129 \n fix(review): cap merged chunk findings at num_max_findings by @utsab345 in #4138 \n fix: keep quoted list settings as lists in parse_command by @utsab345 in #4070 \n fix(github): scope API-URL classification to exact host + path prefix by @depohmel in #4143 \n fix(github): refresh all PR label pages before replacement by @PeterDaveHello in #4083 \n fix: discard stale plain diff context by @utsab345 in #4114 \n fix: honor ignore rules in local diff providers by @utsab345 in #4110 \n fix(gitea): skip inline comments on lines outside the diff by @fbidu in #4130 \n fix(gitea): read renamed base from old path by @utsab345 in #4132 \n fix(gitea): encode raw file content paths by @jiuyueQ in #4106 \n fix: include DNS validation in URL fetch timeouts by @oleksii-tumanov in #4109 \n fix(diff): bound context at adjacent hunks by @utsab345 in #4086 \n fix(diff): decode UTF-16 file content correctly by @utsab345 in #4096 \n fix(describe): preserve success when final feedback fails by @oleksii-tumanov in #4092 \n fix(describe): skip file walkthrough entries with empty fields by @utsab345 in #4082 \n fix(codecommit): report unreadable changed files by @utsab345 in #4133 \n fix: avoid partial Azure incremental reviews by @utsab345 in #4099 \n fix(bitbucket): prevent fork changelog writes by @utsab345 in #4098 \n fix(gitlab): match ticket URLs to the configured origin by @oleksii-tumanov in #4097 \n fix(similar_issue): retry after filtering excluded hits by @oleksii-tumanov in #4104 \n fix: avoid invented GitLab file changes by @utsab345 in #4100 \n \n ⚡ Performance \n \n perf(bitbucket): reuse the initial diffstat result by @oleksii-tumanov in #4356 \n perf(github): avoid refetching inline question thread comments by @PeterDaveHello in #4345 \n perf: defer unused per-file extended diff token counts by @PeterDaveHello in #4349 \n perf(similar_issue): batch indexed issue lookups by @PeterDaveHello in #4339 \n perf(gitlab): fetch incremental commits in larger pages by @PeterDaveHello in #4318 \n perf(diff): release discarded extended patches before repacking by @PeterDaveHello in #4317 \n perf(gitlab): load submodule mappings only for expandable changes by @PeterDaveHello in #4314 \n perf(github): reuse revision-pinned configuration tree paths by @PeterDaveHello in #4311 \n perf(context): expand repository globs only within the line budget by @PeterDaveHello in #4310 \n perf(gitlab): reuse revision-pinned configuration tree paths by @PeterDaveHello in #4270 \n perf(similar_issue): defer comments until an issue is indexable by @PeterDaveHello in #4269 \n perf(gitlab): cache stable merge request changes by @utsab345 in #4254 \n perf(gitlab): stop fetching discussions after finding the target by @PeterDaveHello in #4235 \n perf(gitlab): count changed lines without splitting patches by @PeterDaveHello in #4238 \n perf(improve): stop scanning comments once the summary is found by @PeterDaveHello in #4240 \n perf(config): reuse the request-scoped git provider by @PeterDaveHello in #4243 \n perf(review): skip ticket lookups for unchanged incremental reviews by @PeterDaveHello in #4236 \n perf(gitlab): avoid redundant project fetches before comparisons by @PeterDaveHello in #4242 \n perf(webhooks): release body chunks before processing requests by @PeterDaveHello in #4208 \n perf(similar_issue): narrow LanceDB lookups to candidate issue IDs by @PeterDaveHello in #4211 \n perf(describe): index file statistics when rendering walkthroughs by @PeterDaveHello in #4213 \n perf(help_docs): stop the root README scan before descending by @PeterDaveHello in #4207 \n perf(similar_issue): skip unused comments when preparing queries by @PeterDaveHello in #4212 \n perf(review): avoid extracting code snippets that are not displayed by @PeterDaveHello in #4210 \n perf(similar_issue): batch embeddings before individual retries by @PeterDaveHello in #4189 \n perf(diff): normalize excluded extensions once per file batch by @PeterDaveHello in #4187 \n perf(github): reduce API calls for paginated lists by @PeterDaveHello in #4184 \n perf(github-action): skip unused provider initialization by @PeterDaveHello in #4181 \n perf(changelog): skip waits when no follow-up review is needed by @PeterDaveHello in #4185 \n perf(gitlab): skip project lookup when fetching a merge request by @PeterDaveHello in #4183 \n perf(github): reuse revision-pinned file contents across commands by @PeterDaveHello in #4165 \n perf(similar_issue): avoid eager issue pagination during indexing by @PeterDaveHello in #4169 \n perf(gitlab): reduce pagination requests for commit messages by @PeterDaveHello in #4164 \n perf(gitlab): avoid project fetch before language stats by @PeterDaveHello in #4163 \n perf(github): fetch issue sub-issues in one GraphQL request by @PeterDaveHello in #4157 \n perf(ask_line): avoid full PR reads for language logging by @PeterDaveHello in #4156 \n perf: defer Gitea diff and commit fetches by @utsab345 in #4103 \n perf(improve): avoid truncation work for required suggestion chunks by @PeterDaveHello in #4146 \n perf(config): reuse remote extra config payloads per request by @PeterDaveHello in #4043 \n perf(codecommit): cache completed empty file lists by @oleksii-tumanov in #4127 \n perf(bitbucket): avoid unused Server base lookups by @oleksii-tumanov in #4108 \n perf: batch LanceDB issue index checks by @utsab345 in #4115 \n perf(gitlab): cache verified empty diff results by @PeterDaveHello in #4085 \n perf(github): limit thread lookup to root comments by @PeterDaveHello in #4113 \n perf(github): filter check-run lookups by name by @PeterDaveHello in #4112 \n perf(github): reuse command provider for polling reactions by @PeterDaveHello in #4084 \n perf(gitlab): skip fetching MR commits without an incremental anchor by @PeterDaveHello in #4147 \n \n 📚 Documentation \n \n docs: clarify setup steps and section hierarchy across guides by @PeterDaveHello in #4342 \n docs: clarify the uv version requirement in CONTRIBUTING.md by @PeterDaveHello in #4308 \n docs: add review checklist by @utsab345 in #4298 \n docs: add \"Incorrect API key provided: dummy_key\" to the GitHub Action troubleshooting list by @qwist1233-cpu in #4199 \n docs: stop examples from repeating the primary model in fallback_models by @utsab345 in #4205 \n docs: Scope agent lint fixes to changed files and preserve valid ignores by @PeterDaveHello in #4159 \n docs: add API Route configuration example by @DennyHo0917 in #4153 \n docs: Align AGENTS.md with repository configuration and test workflows by @PeterDaveHello in #4158 \n \n 🧹 Maintenance \n \n chore(deps): Upgrade Langfuse to v4 for continued SDK and server support by @PeterDaveHello in #4343 \n chore(docker): refresh pinned Lambda Python 3.14 base image by @PeterDaveHello in #4309 \n chore(docker): upgrade Python base image to 3.14.9 by @PeterDaveHello in #4316 \n chore: upgrade Ruff to 0.17.2 by @utsab345 in #4304 \n chore: run pre-commit through uvx by @utsab345 in #4299 \n chore(deps): Upgrade OpenTelemetry and virtualenv by @PeterDaveHello in #4271 \n chore: add FURB ruff rules by @even-even in #4216 \n chore: add UP ruff rule by @even-even in #4067 \n chore(deps): update LiteLLM to 1.105.1 by @PeterDaveHello in #4151 \n chore(models): use GPT-6.1 Sol defaults with GPT-6 Luna fallback by @PeterDaveHello in #4088 \n \n ⬆️ Dependencies \n \n chore(deps): bump body-parser from 1.20.8 to 1.20.9 in /docs by @ dependabot[bot] in #4352 \n chore(deps): bump fast-uri from 3.1.8 to 3.1.9 in /docs by @ dependabot[bot] in #4351 \n chore(deps): bump undici from 7.29.1 to 7.30.1 in /docs by @ dependabot[bot] in #4350 \n chore(deps): bump launch-editor from 2.14.1 to 2.14.2 in /docs by @ dependabot[bot] in #4218 \n chore(deps): bump certifi from 2026.7.22 to 2026.10.19 by @ dependabot[bot] in #4217 \n chore(deps): bump follow-redirects from 1.16.0 to 1.16.1 in /docs by @ dependabot[bot] in #4215 \n chore(deps): bump the python-minor-and-patch group with 12 updates by @ dependabot[bot] in #4192 \n chore(ci): bump the actions-minor-and-patch group with 3 updates by @ dependabot[bot] in #4191 \n chore(deps): bump the docs-minor-and-patch group in /docs with 2 updates by @ dependabot[bot] in #4190 \n \n Full Changelog : v0.48.0...v0.49.0 \n \n \n Contributors \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n