lyPaleAle ) \n remove not used permissions ( 942bb3b by @stonith404 ) \n upgrade vulnerable dependencies ( f6b02ef by @stonith404 ) \n fix missing data in database.json ( 6e859de by @stonith404 ) \n Bump the \"all-dependencies\" group with 3 updates across multiple ecosystems ( #1621 by @dependabot [bot]) \n use NewTextHandler instead of NewHandler for tint ( 8563934 by @stonith404 ) \n run unit tests on windows and linux ( 31d62c6 by @stonith404 ) \n correctly close filesystems ( 6bd4679 by @stonith404 ) \n modularize email module and use actor for email verification ( #1625 by @stonith404 ) \n pin version of fosite fork ( 91d3712 by @stonith404 ) \n translations remove unused translation strings ( d5eb3fe by @stonith404 ) \n enforce eslint rules ( 9060291 by @stonith404 ) \n upgrade vulnerable dependencies ( 0c5e014 by @stonith404 ) \n \n Full Changelog : v2.11.0...v2.12.0 \n \n \n Contributors \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n ItalyPaleAle, schnz, and 3 other contributors\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n Assets \n 16 \n \n \n \n \n \n Loading \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n Uh oh!\n \n There was an error while loading. Please reload this page . \n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n \n --> \n \n \n 👍 \n 5 \n kevinhoman, SimonAlparaz, Razdnut, outarde, and dobbry-vechur reacted with thumbs up emoji \n 🎉 \n 9 \n Djerbiien, Taubin, paulkellermann, rokf, mr-woodapple, svengo, SimonAlparaz, NickSkier, and ElioDiNino reacted with hooray emoji \n ❤️ \n 7 \n Djerbiien, Taubin, paulkellermann, 56k-modem, SimonAlparaz, GiorgioMendieta, and ElioDiNino reacted with heart emoji \n 🚀 \n 6 \n Djerbiien, Taubin, paulkellermann, SimonAlparaz, sma33in, and pxlnvdr reacted with rocket emoji \n \n \n \n All reactions \n \n \n\n \n \n 👍 \n 5 reactions \n \n \n 🎉 \n 9 reactions \n \n \n ❤️ \n 7 reactions \n \n \n 🚀 \n 6 reactions \n \n \n \n \n \n 17 people reacted \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n\n \n\n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n Footer \n\n \n\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 